this repository. download.sh retrieves a community GGUF conversion derived
from NVIDIA/NVIDIA-NemotronLabs-VoiceChat-11B. The model materials remain
subject to NVIDIA's OpenMDW License Agreement, version 1.1, and the notices and
terms in the upstream model repositories:

